      "text": "register\n    - method : post\n    - endpoint : /auth/register\n    - request body :\n        - email\n        - username\n        - password\n        - confirm_password\n    - response (201) :\n        - message : registration success. please verify your email\n        - data : \n            - user_id : ....\n            - status : pending",
