      "updated": 1766676130897,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FLOW / ALUR :\n- user input email\n- sistem melakukan validasi email\n    - tidak ada email, berikan response error\n    - jika ada, lanjut step berikut nya\n- sistem cek data di tabel email_verification_tokens by user_id\n- sistem hapus data data semua old token by user_id\n- sistem generate ulang token, dan kirim token via email",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FLOW / ALUR :\n- user input email\n- sistem melakukan validasi email\n    - tidak ada email, berikan response error\n    - jika ada, lanjut step berikut nya\n- sistem cek data di tabel email_verification_tokens by user_id\n- sistem hapus data data semua old token by user_id\n- sistem generate ulang token, dan kirim token via email",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
