      "updated": 1766682826131,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow \n1. decode token\n2. cek expired\n    - expired => dapatkan token dulu\n    - belum expired => lanjut step 3\n3. validasi password (by user_id yang diambil dari decode token)\n    - password salah => kirim error\n    - password benar => lanjut step 4\n4. delete semua session yang berhubungan dengan user tersebut\n5. delete data user tersebut\n6. delete cookie : refresh token",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow \n1. decode token\n2. cek expired\n    - expired => dapatkan token dulu\n    - belum expired => lanjut step 3\n3. validasi password (by user_id yang diambil dari decode token)\n    - password salah => kirim error\n    - password benar => lanjut step 4\n4. delete semua session yang berhubungan dengan user tersebut\n5. delete data user tersebut\n6. delete cookie : refresh token",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
