      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow\n- decode id\n- cek expired token (seperti yang lain)\n- banding kan old_password dengan password user (by user_id)\n    - salah => kirim pesan error\n    - benar => lanjut step berikut nya\n- update data password ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow\n- decode id\n- cek expired token (seperti yang lain)\n- banding kan old_password dengan password user (by user_id)\n    - salah => kirim pesan error\n    - benar => lanjut step berikut nya\n- update data password ",
